        {
          "id": "commentary_09_1-guidance-9",
          "type": "commentary_guidance",
          "text": "The details above describe what is required to reach the lower mark (1, 3 or 5) in each of the \nthree Levels. In each case, just one additional piece of information is required to achieve the \nhigher mark in the respective level. However, several unlinked ideas might be given but this \nwill not raise the mark beyond the higher mark in that Level.",
          "order": 11,
          "parent_id": null,
